  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Risk-Informed Development for Resilience (RID4R) project, implemented by DoDMA with support from UNDP, aims to strengthen Malawi&#x2019;s resilience to climate-related and other hazards through risk-informed development planning and systems enhancement. The project is aligned with the Sendai Framework for Disaster Risk Reduction, the Malawi 2063 vision, the National Resilience Strategy (NRS), and the 2023 Disaster Risk Management Act.RID4R adopts a systems approach to resilience by enhancing antici</narrative>
  </description>
