    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of early warning messages disseminated to at-risk communities</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tracks the total count of early warning messages issued and shared with communities at risk of hazards. This includes messages on impending floods, droughts, storms, or other hazards, disseminated through any official communication channel.</narrative>
